<title>CHINA: Samson Paper year net falls 48.8 pct.</title>
<headline>Samson Paper year net falls 48.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   10.9 vs 25.5</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    1.5 vs 7.5</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    43.61 vs 85.22</p>
<p>    Turnover		     1,778.24 vs 1,734.19</p>
<p>    Company name		 Samson Paper Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  Sept 5-12</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   Sept 30</p>
<p>NOTE - Samson Paper is engaged in trading and marketing of paper products.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 3.5 H.K. cents (including interim dividend of two cents) vs 7.5 cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
